{"4854120":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Ski Lines: Trail Map","steam_appid":4854120,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[5030220],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ski Lines is a minimalist strategy simulation game about designing a ski resort map.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw ski runs, build lifts, and connect mountain landmarks as new points of interest appear across the slopes. Every day, more skiers arrive, new destinations open, and your resort becomes harder to keep flowing.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple: keep skiers moving.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4854120\/extras\/f62eff769c236b297bcaed9c8a438529.avif?t=1792599201\" width=1232 height=706 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a small mountain and a handful of resources. Connect stations, summits, viewpoints, restaurants, refuges, and rescue points with the right mix of pistes and lifts. Easy runs are flexible, harder runs are more demanding, and every new connection changes the shape of your network.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4854120\/extras\/fcb91c033e59bb51df0de255ddc5d735.poster.avif?t=1792599201\" width=1170 height=266 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4854120\/extras\/fcb91c033e59bb51df0de255ddc5d735.webm?t=1792599201\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4854120\/extras\/fcb91c033e59bb51df0de255ddc5d735.mp4?t=1792599201\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the mountain is not just a blank canvas. Snow cannons let you expand the skiable area, while tree clearing allows you to open new routes through the forest. Upgrade your lifts, improve your tools, and choose carefully where to invest your limited resources.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4854120\/extras\/f01f1cad22b17e3dae1a4422d9562d36.poster.avif?t=1792599201\" width=1170 height=266 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4854120\/extras\/f01f1cad22b17e3dae1a4422d9562d36.webm?t=1792599201\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4854120\/extras\/f01f1cad22b17e3dae1a4422d9562d36.mp4?t=1792599201\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the days pass, the resort grows busier. New points of interest appear, skiers demand better routes, and bottlenecks begin to form. Redesign your network, extend the domain, and adapt before the slopes become overwhelmed.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4854120\/extras\/28c09cf1d27c5dac2799558203b5db64.poster.avif?t=1792599201\" width=1170 height=266 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4854120\/extras\/28c09cf1d27c5dac2799558203b5db64.webm?t=1792599201\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4854120\/extras\/28c09cf1d27c5dac2799558203b5db64.mp4?t=1792599201\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw ski pistes directly on a stylized trail map.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build lifts to bring skiers back up the mountain.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect stations, summits, restaurants, refuges, viewpoints, and more.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use snow cannons to expand the skiable area.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear trees to open new routes through forests.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade lifts, snow cannons, and other tools as your resort grows.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage limited resources and choose your expansions wisely.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your network as new points of interest appear each day.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play across famous ski regions inspired by resorts around the world.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy replayable runs with roguelike progression and evolving mountain layouts.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level editor &amp; Community maps<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ski Lines is a minimalist strategy simulation game about designing a ski resort map.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw ski runs, build lifts, and connect mountain landmarks as new points of interest appear across the slopes. Every day, more skiers arrive, new destinations open, and your resort becomes harder to keep flowing.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple: keep skiers moving.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4854120\/extras\/f62eff769c236b297bcaed9c8a438529.avif?t=1792599201\" width=1232 height=706 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a small mountain and a handful of resources. Connect stations, summits, viewpoints, restaurants, refuges, and rescue points with the right mix of pistes and lifts. Easy runs are flexible, harder runs are more demanding, and every new connection changes the shape of your network.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4854120\/extras\/fcb91c033e59bb51df0de255ddc5d735.poster.avif?t=1792599201\" width=1170 height=266 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4854120\/extras\/fcb91c033e59bb51df0de255ddc5d735.webm?t=1792599201\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4854120\/extras\/fcb91c033e59bb51df0de255ddc5d735.mp4?t=1792599201\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the mountain is not just a blank canvas. Snow cannons let you expand the skiable area, while tree clearing allows you to open new routes through the forest. Upgrade your lifts, improve your tools, and choose carefully where to invest your limited resources.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4854120\/extras\/f01f1cad22b17e3dae1a4422d9562d36.poster.avif?t=1792599201\" width=1170 height=266 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4854120\/extras\/f01f1cad22b17e3dae1a4422d9562d36.webm?t=1792599201\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4854120\/extras\/f01f1cad22b17e3dae1a4422d9562d36.mp4?t=1792599201\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the days pass, the resort grows busier. New points of interest appear, skiers demand better routes, and bottlenecks begin to form. Redesign your network, extend the domain, and adapt before the slopes become overwhelmed.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4854120\/extras\/28c09cf1d27c5dac2799558203b5db64.poster.avif?t=1792599201\" width=1170 height=266 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4854120\/extras\/28c09cf1d27c5dac2799558203b5db64.webm?t=1792599201\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4854120\/extras\/28c09cf1d27c5dac2799558203b5db64.mp4?t=1792599201\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw ski pistes directly on a stylized trail map.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build lifts to bring skiers back up the mountain.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect stations, summits, restaurants, refuges, viewpoints, and more.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use snow cannons to expand the skiable area.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear trees to open new routes through forests.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade lifts, snow cannons, and other tools as your resort grows.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage limited resources and choose your expansions wisely.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your network as new points of interest appear each day.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play across famous ski regions inspired by resorts around the world.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy replayable runs with roguelike progression and evolving mountain layouts.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level editor &amp; Community maps<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"Ski Lines is a minimalist strategy game about designing a ski resort map. Draw pistes, build lifts, and connect mountain landmarks as new points of interest appear. Spend your limited resources wisely, adapt your network each day, and keep the resort moving for as long as possible.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, French<strong>*<\/strong>, Italian<strong>*<\/strong>, German<strong>*<\/strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*<\/strong>, Russian<strong>*<\/strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4854120\/25fdf514a9cf93f391e3f5c84314b36a7a59e1a3\/header.jpg?t=1792599201","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4854120\/a87438d187999b54dcbb2e8342cea1e019784cab\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1792599201","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4854120\/a87438d187999b54dcbb2e8342cea1e019784cab\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1792599201","website":"https:\/\/yunogames.studio\/en\/ski-lines","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS *:<\/strong> Windows 7 SP1, 8, 10 or later<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> 2 GHz or faster processor<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Shader Model 4.0<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 400 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 14<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Apple M1 or Intel<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 400 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul cl